.SH "NAME"
TreeSitter::Detector::Candidate \- A language \fB\%Detector#detect\fR considered: its \fB\%probability\fR after the parse check, and \fB\%error_ratio\fR, the share of the text (0.0 to 1.0) its grammar could not parse, \fB\%nil\fR when the grammar was not checked.
